<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Session Fixation - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>🔐 Session Fixation</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-medium">Medium</span><span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 20 pts</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>The login endpoint accepts a session ID via URL parameter and doesn't regenerate it after authentication. Fix a session, trick the victim into logging in with it, then hijack their session.</p>
      <p><strong>Your current session:</strong> <code><%= sessionId %></code></p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Vulnerable Login Link</h2>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Set session ID (attacker controls this):</label>
        <input type="text" id="fixedSid" value="attacker-known-session-123" autocomplete="off">
        <button onclick="fixSession()" class="btn">Login with Fixed Session</button>
      </div>
      <div id="fixResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <div class="code-block">Attack Flow:
1. Attacker generates: /labs/auth/session-fixation/login?sid=KNOWN_VALUE
2. Attacker sends link to victim
3. Victim clicks → logs in → session stays as KNOWN_VALUE
4. Attacker uses KNOWN_VALUE session → authenticated as victim!</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('session-fixation','flagInput_sf','flagResult_sf'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_sf" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_sf" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    async function fixSession() {
      const sid = document.getElementById('fixedSid').value;
      const res = await fetch(`/labs/auth/session-fixation/login?sid=${encodeURIComponent(sid)}`);
      document.getElementById('fixResult').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(await res.json(),null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
